  "title": "Navigator Holdings Ltd. Announces Award for Best Integrated Logistics CSR by Capital Finance International",
  "summary": "December 14, 2021 – Navigator Holdings Ltd. (“Navigator”) (NYSE: NVGS), the owner and operator of the world’s largest fleet of handysize liquefied gas carriers, is delighted to announce that it has been awarded “Best Integrated Logistics CSR – Global 2021” as part of the Capital Finance International CSR Awards 2021. Oeyvind Lindeman, Chief Commercial Officer, […]",
